<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head') %>

</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main id="main-content">

<section class="sh-page-hero" aria-label="Oil & Gas hero">
  <div class="sh-container">
    <nav class="sh-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a><span class="sh-breadcrumb__sep">/</span><a href="/services">Industries</a><span class="sh-breadcrumb__sep">/</span><span aria-current="page">Oil & Gas</span>
    </nav>
    <h1>Oil & Gas Engineering Solutions</h1>
    <p>Drilling components, pipeline fittings, and field equipment fabrication for the demanding oil and gas industry in Nigeria.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sh-section" aria-labelledby="overview-heading">
  <div class="sh-container">
    <div class="row align-items-center">
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-12 mb-4">
        <div class="sh-section-title sh-section-title--left">
          <h2 id="overview-heading">Precision Components for Oil & Gas</h2>
          <p>We understand the unique demands of the oil & gas sector and engineer components that meet strict performance, safety, and durability standards.</p>
        </div>
        <ul style="margin-top:var(--sh-space-6);">
          <li style="margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-3);display:flex;gap:var(--sh-space-3);align-items:flex-start;"><i class="fa fa-check-circle" style="color:var(--sh-brand);margin-top:3px;"></i><span>Pipeline fittings and connectors</span></li><li style="margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-3);display:flex;gap:var(--sh-space-3);align-items:flex-start;"><i class="fa fa-check-circle" style="color:var(--sh-brand);margin-top:3px;"></i><span>Drilling equipment components</span></li><li style="margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-3);display:flex;gap:var(--sh-space-3);align-items:flex-start;"><i class="fa fa-check-circle" style="color:var(--sh-brand);margin-top:3px;"></i><span>Field service tools and fixtures</span></li><li style="margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-3);display:flex;gap:var(--sh-space-3);align-items:flex-start;"><i class="fa fa-check-circle" style="color:var(--sh-brand);margin-top:3px;"></i><span>Pressure vessel parts</span></li><li style="margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-3);display:flex;gap:var(--sh-space-3);align-items:flex-start;"><i class="fa fa-check-circle" style="color:var(--sh-brand);margin-top:3px;"></i><span>Custom fabrication for offshore applications</span></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="sh-mt-8">
          <a href="/request-quote" class="sh-btn sh-btn--primary">Get Oil & Gas Components</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="sh-btn sh-btn--outline" style="margin-left:var(--sh-space-3);">Contact Us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-12">
        <div class="sh-card sh-animate" style="padding:0;overflow:hidden;">
          <img src="/img/oilfield.jpeg" alt="Oil & Gas engineering" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400" style="width:100%;height:auto;">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sh-section" style="background:var(--sh-surface);" aria-labelledby="cap-heading">
  <div class="sh-container">
    <div class="sh-section-title">
      <h2 id="cap-heading">How We Support Oil & Gas</h2>
      <p>Our manufacturing technologies are adapted to meet the specific needs of your industry.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sh-grid sh-grid--4">
      <article class="sh-card sh-animate"><div class="sh-service__icon" style="margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-4);"><i class="icofont-cube"></i></div><h4>3D Printing</h4><p class="sh-text-small">Rapid prototyping and custom part production for specialized applications.</p></article>
      <article class="sh-card sh-animate"><div class="sh-service__icon" style="margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-4);"><i class="icofont-flash"></i></div><h4>Laser Cutting</h4><p class="sh-text-small">Precision cutting for intricate components and tight-tolerance parts.</p></article>
      <article class="sh-card sh-animate"><div class="sh-service__icon" style="margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-4);"><i class="icofont-settings"></i></div><h4>CNC Punching</h4><p class="sh-text-small">High-volume production of standardized components with consistency.</p></article>
      <article class="sh-card sh-animate"><div class="sh-service__icon" style="margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-4);"><i class="icofont-fire-burn"></i></div><h4>Plasma Cutting</h4><p class="sh-text-small">Heavy-duty fabrication for structural and load-bearing components.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sh-cta">
  <div class="sh-container">
    <h2>Ready to Start Your Oil & Gas Project?</h2>
    <p>Discuss your requirements with our engineering team and get a tailored manufacturing solution.</p>
    <div class="sh-cta__actions">
      <a href="/request-quote" class="sh-btn sh-btn--primary sh-btn--lg">Request a Quote</a>
      <a href="/contact" class="sh-btn sh-btn--ghost sh-btn--lg">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
<%- include('partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>
